<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Checkout AjatMed — Concluir cadastro</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Conclua seu cadastro AjatMed e siga para o pagamento seguro via Asaas. Telemedicina 24/7 para você, sua família e seus pets.">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/logo.png">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@700;800&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<body>
<header class="topbar">
  <div class="topbar-inner">
    <span class="brand" id="brandWrap">
      <img src="/logo.png" alt="AjatMed — saúde mais perto de você" onerror="document.getElementById('brandWrap').classList.add('no-logo')">
      <span class="brand-fallback"><strong>AjatMed</strong><span>Telemedicina</span></span>
    </span>
    <div class="topbar-right">
      <span class="secure-pill">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg>
        Ambiente seguro
      </span>
      <a class="back-link" href="https://www.ajatmed.com.br">
        <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 12H5"/><path d="m12 19-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
        <span>Voltar ao site</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="stepper-bar">
  <ol class="stepper" aria-label="Etapas da contratação">
    <li aria-current="step"><span class="step-dot">1</span><span class="step-label">Seus dados</span></li>
    <li aria-current="false"><span class="step-sep" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="step-dot">2</span><span class="step-label">Endereço</span></li>
    <li aria-current="false"><span class="step-sep" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="step-dot">3</span><span class="step-label">Foto e extras</span></li>
    <li aria-current="false"><span class="step-sep" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="step-dot">4</span><span class="step-label">Revisar e pagar</span></li>
  </ol>
</div>

<div class="wrap">
  <div class="layout">
    <main class="card" id="formCard" aria-label="Formulário de cadastro">
      <div class="card-hairline" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <form id="form" action="/submit" method="POST" enctype="multipart/form-data" novalidate>
          <span class="eyebrow"><span class="dot-gold" aria-hidden="true">✦</span> Checkout AjatMed</span>
          <h1 class="page-title">Quase lá — complete seu cadastro</h1>
          <p class="page-sub">Leva menos de 2 minutos. Depois você segue para o pagamento seguro.</p>

          <!-- Etapa 1 -->
          <section class="step-panel" aria-label="Seus dados">
            <fieldset>
              <legend>
                <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H9a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"/></svg>
                Dados pessoais
              </legend>
              <div class="grid">
                <div class="field span-12">
                  <label for="nomeCompleto">Nome completo *</label>
                  <input id="nomeCompleto" name="nomeCompleto" required autocomplete="name" placeholder="Como está no seu documento">
                </div>
                <div class="field span-6">
                  <label for="cpf">CPF * <span class="light">(será seu login)</span></label>
                  <input id="cpf" name="cpf" class="mono" required inputmode="numeric" placeholder="000.000.000-00" aria-describedby="cpfErr">
                  <div class="err" id="cpfErr" role="alert">CPF inválido.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="field span-6">
                  <label for="rg">RG <span class="light">(opcional)</span></label>
                  <input id="rg" name="rg" autocomplete="off" placeholder="00.000.000-0">
                </div>
                <div class="field span-4">
                  <label for="dataNascimento">Nascimento *</label>
                  <input type="date" id="dataNascimento" name="dataNascimento" class="mono" required>
                </div>
                <div class="field span-8">
                  <label for="sexo">Sexo *</label>
                  <select id="sexo" name="sexo" required>
                    <option value="">Selecione…</option>
                    <option>Masculino</option>
                    <option>Feminino</option>
                    <option>Outro</option>
                  </select>
                </div>
              </div>
            </fieldset>

            <hr class="sep">

            <fieldset>
              <legend>
                <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg>
                Acesso ao sistema
              </legend>
              <div class="grid">
                <div class="field span-6">
                  <label for="senha">Crie uma senha *</label>
                  <input type="password" id="senha" name="senha" required minlength="6" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="Mínimo 6 caracteres">
                </div>
                <div class="field span-6">
                  <label for="confirmarSenha">Confirmar senha *</label>
                  <input type="password" id="confirmarSenha" name="confirmarSenha" required minlength="6" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="Repita a senha" aria-describedby="senhaErr">
                  <div class="err" id="senhaErr" role="alert">As senhas não conferem.</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </fieldset>

            <div class="step-nav">
              <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-next>Continuar
                <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg>
              </button>
            </div>
          </section>

          <!-- Etapa 2 -->
          <section class="step-panel" aria-label="Endereço e contato" hidden>
            <fieldset>
              <legend>
                <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0 1 16 0Z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg>
                Endereço
                <span class="cep-status" id="cepStatus" aria-live="polite">Buscando CEP…</span>
              </legend>
              <div class="grid">
                <div class="field span-4">
                  <label for="cep">CEP *</label>
                  <div class="input-wrap" id="cepWrap">
                    <input id="cep" name="cep" class="mono" required inputmode="numeric" placeholder="00000-000" aria-describedby="cepHint">
                    <span class="spinner" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="hint" id="cepHint" aria-live="polite">Digite o CEP para preencher automaticamente.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="field span-8">
                  <label for="rua">Rua / Avenida *</label>
                  <input id="rua" name="rua" required autocomplete="street-address" placeholder="Av. Paulista">
                </div>
                <div class="field span-4">
                  <label for="numero">Número *</label>
                  <input id="numero" name="numero" required autocomplete="off" placeholder="1000">
                </div>
                <div class="field span-8">
                  <label for="complemento">Complemento</label>
                  <input id="complemento" name="complemento" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Apto, bloco, referência (opcional)">
                </div>
                <div class="field span-4">
                  <label for="bairro">Bairro *</label>
                  <input id="bairro" name="bairro" required placeholder="Bela Vista">
                </div>
                <div class="field span-4">
                  <label for="cidade">Cidade *</label>
                  <input id="cidade" name="cidade" required autocomplete="address-level2" placeholder="São Paulo">
                </div>
                <div class="field span-4">
                  <label for="estado">Estado *</label>
                  <select id="estado" name="estado" required autocomplete="address-level1">
                    <option value="">UF…</option>
                    <option>AC</option><option>AL</option><option>AP</option><option>AM</option><option>BA</option><option>CE</option><option>DF</option><option>ES</option><option>GO</option><option>MA</option><option>MT</option><option>MS</option><option>MG</option><option>PA</option><option>PB</option><option>PR</option><option>PE</option><option>PI</option><option>RJ</option><option>RN</option><option>RS</option><option>RO</option><option>RR</option><option>SC</option><option>SP</option><option>SE</option><option>TO</option>
                  </select>
                </div>
              </div>
            </fieldset>

            <hr class="sep">

            <fieldset>
              <legend>
                <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.13.96.36 1.9.7 2.8a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.1L8.1 9.9a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.45c.9.34 1.84.57 2.8.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.9z"/></svg>
                Contato
              </legend>
              <div class="grid">
                <div class="field span-6">
                  <label for="telefone">Telefone / WhatsApp *</label>
                  <input id="telefone" name="telefone" class="mono" required placeholder="(11) 99999-9999" inputmode="tel" autocomplete="tel">
                </div>
                <div class="field span-6">
                  <label for="email">E-mail *</label>
                  <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email" placeholder="voce@email.com">
                </div>
              </div>
            </fieldset>

            <div class="step-nav">
              <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost" data-prev>
                <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 12H5"/><path d="m12 19-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
                Voltar
              </button>
              <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-next>Continuar
                <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg>
              </button>
            </div>
          </section>

          <!-- Etapa 3 -->
          <section class="step-panel" aria-label="Foto e extras" hidden>
            <h2>Sua foto</h2>
            <p class="step-desc">Usamos na sua carteirinha digital do beneficiário.</p>
            <label class="drop" for="foto">
              <strong>📷 Selecionar foto do beneficiário</strong>
              <span class="hint">PNG ou JPG, até 2MB</span>
              <input type="file" id="foto" name="fotoBeneficiario" accept=".png,.jpg,.jpeg">
            </label>
            <img id="preview" class="preview" alt="Prévia da foto enviada">
            <div class="err" id="fotoErr" role="alert">Arquivo inválido. Use PNG ou JPG de até 2MB.</div>

            <hr class="sep">

            <h2>Dependentes</h2>
            <p class="step-desc">Opcional e sem custo extra — <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost" id="addDep">+ Adicionar dependente</button></p>
            <div id="deps"></div>

            <hr class="sep">

            <h2>Pets</h2>
            <p class="step-desc">Opcional e sem custo extra — <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost" id="addPet">+ Adicionar pet</button></p>
            <div id="pets"></div>

            <input type="hidden" name="dependentesJson" id="dependentesJson">
            <input type="hidden" name="petsJson" id="petsJson">

            <div class="step-nav">
              <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost" data-prev>
                <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 12H5"/><path d="m12 19-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
                Voltar
              </button>
              <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-next>Revisar dados
                <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg>
              </button>
            </div>
          </section>

          <!-- Etapa 4 -->
          <section class="step-panel" aria-label="Revisar e pagar" hidden>
            <h2>Confira tudo</h2>
            <p class="step-desc">Revise seus dados antes de concluir. Você será levado ao pagamento seguro do Asaas.</p>
            <dl class="review" id="reviewList"></dl>
            <div class="note48">⏱️ Os cadastros serão feitos manualmente no sistema de telemedicina com prazo máximo de 48h após a confirmação do pagamento.</div>
            <button class="btn btn-pay" type="submit">
              <svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg>
              Concluir cadastro e ir para o pagamento
            </button>
            <p class="secure-line">🔒 Pagamento criptografado SSL 256-bit via <strong>Asaas</strong>, instituição de pagamento autorizada pelo Banco Central.</p>
            <div class="step-nav">
              <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost" data-prev>Voltar e corrigir</button>
            </div>
          </section>
        </form>
      </div>
    </main>

    <aside class="summary-col sticky" aria-label="Resumo do pedido">
      <div class="summary-card">
        <div class="summary-head">
          <span class="summary-logo" aria-hidden="true">
            <img src="/favicon.png" alt="" onerror="this.remove()">
          </span>
          <div>
            <p class="summary-eyebrow">Resumo do pedido</p>
            <h2 class="summary-plan"><%= typeof planName !== 'undefined' ? planName : 'Plano Individual AjatMed' %></h2>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="summary-lines">
          <div class="line"><span>Mensalidade</span><strong>R$ <%= typeof planValueFmt !== 'undefined' ? planValueFmt : '59,77' %></strong></div>
          <div class="line free"><span>Taxa de adesão</span><span>Grátis</span></div>
          <div class="line free"><span>Carência · Clínico geral</span><span>Zero</span></div>
          <div class="summary-total">
            <span class="t-label">Total mensal</span>
            <span class="t-value">R$ <%= typeof planValueFmt !== 'undefined' ? planValueFmt : '59,77' %></span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="summary-included">
          <h3>Incluso na assinatura</h3>
          <p><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Consultas ilimitadas 24/7 com Clínico Geral</p>
          <p><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Acesso a mais de 20 especialidades médicas</p>
          <p><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Receitas digitais, atestados e pedidos de exames</p>
          <p><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Clube de benefícios: farmácias e exames com desconto</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="concierge-card">
        <strong>Dúvidas na contratação?</strong>
        <p>Nosso concierge ajuda no WhatsApp.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-whats" href="<%= typeof whatsappUrl !== 'undefined' ? whatsappUrl : 'https://wa.me/5511999999999' %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z"/></svg>
          Falar com concierge
        </a>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</div>

<footer class="footer">
  <div class="footer-inner">
    <div class="footer-brand">
      <img src="/logo.png" alt="AjatMed" onerror="this.remove()">
      <p><strong>AjatMed Telemedicina</strong> · Conformidade CFM/CRM</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="trust-row" aria-label="Selos de segurança e conformidade">
      <li><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg>SSL 256-bit</li>
      <li><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>Asaas</li>
      <li>LGPD</li>
      <li>CFM</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</footer>

<script src="/checkout.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
